# WS1-05. Source: spec/02-types.md §10: every shift is defined, with the count
# masked to the operand width; -1 & 31 = 31, so 1 << -1 is -2147483648 for i32,
# folded and at run time.
expect: output
contrast: shlI32(1, -1) ==> shlI32(1, 30)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
-2147483648 -2147483648
--- contrast-output
-2147483648 1073741824
